      "rationale": "Dependabot monitors every package ecosystem in the monorepo (npm at root, /robot trader and /server workspaces, uv for ml_service) on a weekly cadence to keep transitive trading-backend dependencies patched without manual triage."
    },
    {
      "id": "_github_workflows_cd_pipeline",
      "label": "Continuous Deployment Pipeline",
      "file_type": "concept",
